WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:03.240
They [elders] did talk about their lives.

2
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:07.480
They just didn’t talk about the slave ancestry.

3
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:16.680
It’s almost as if there had been a message of shame connected to having been enslaved, as if it could possibly have been their fault.

4
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:28.000
It was just nothing . . . it was just something . . . My impression was that it wasn’t something to be proud of.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.860
It was more something to be ashamed of.

6
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:34.440
Or I don’t know, embarrassed by it.
